# This file documents the crate/subsystem ownership of the Rustty project.
#
# Rustty (https://github.com/AirelyDev/rustty) is a full-fidelity port of
# Ghostty (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty) to Rust. Every path is
# currently owned by @AirelyDev.
#
# The catch-all rule below is the source of truth and guarantees complete
# coverage. The subsystem blocks that follow are documentary only — they map
# crates to subsystems for when ownership is split out as the project grows.
# CODEOWNERS uses last-match-wins, so the blocks can reassign a subsystem
# independently once other maintainers join.

# Default owner for everything.
*   @AirelyDev

# --- Subsystem map (documentary; all currently @AirelyDev) ---------------

# Font
/crates/rustty-font/            @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-font-shaper/     @AirelyDev

# Renderer
/crates/rustty-renderer/        @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-render-types/    @AirelyDev

# Terminal
/crates/rustty-vt/              @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-vt-c/            @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-input/           @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-terminfo/        @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-termio/          @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-unicode/         @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-simd/            @AirelyDev

# Shell
/crates/rustty-extra/shell-integration/   @AirelyDev

# macOS
#
# This includes librustty because the macOS apprt is built on top of
# librustty and often requires or is impacted by changes to librustty.
/crates/rustty-apprt-c/         @AirelyDev
/crates/rustty-os/              @AirelyDev
/macos/                         @AirelyDev
/include/rustty/                @AirelyDev
